flowchart LR
  A["Team learns something — new canonical URL, tone change, new author, new category"] --> B["Admin edits guidelines/ or SKILL.md in the repo"]
  B --> C["git commit and push to origin/main"]
  C --> D["No redeploy, no rebuild — the repo is the product"]
  D --> E["Next writer types /blog"]
  E --> F["Pre-flight: git fetch, count commits behind, check for local changes"]
  F --> G{"Behind origin/main?"}
  G -->|"no"| J["Continue silently"]
  G -->|"yes, working tree clean"| H["Offer fast-forward pull, writer approves"]
  G -->|"yes, but local edits present"| I["Skip auto-pull, warn, continue on current version"]
  H --> K["Skill loads the updated guidelines for this run"]
  I --> K
  J --> K
  K --> L["Every writer converges on the same voice, SEO rules, and schema"]
  L --> A
